  "goodToKnow": "Die Hoheit means highness, as a title (Seine Königliche Hoheit), and sovereignty or jurisdiction: die Lufthoheit (air supremacy), das Hoheitsgebiet (sovereign territory). In German federalism, die Kulturhoheit der Länder means the states control education and culture, which is why school systems and holidays differ between Bavaria and Berlin. Die Deutungshoheit is control over how something is interpreted. Plural: die Hoheiten."
